model & episodes & read the store & read calls & solved \\
\midrule
reported arm & {{HH_N}} & {{HH_HK_READ}} ({{HH_HK_PCT}}\%) & {{HH_HK_CALLS}} & {{HH_HK_SOLVED}} \\
{{M3_NAME}} & {{HH_N}} & {{HH_M3_READ}} ({{HH_M3_PCT}}\%) & {{HH_M3_CALLS}} & {{HH_M3_SOLVED}} \\
